window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"illaoi","b":"masteryi","win":["Illaoi","Illaoi","Illaoi","Illaoi","Illaoi","Illaoi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-3","text":"Slams plus spirit tests own his weak early game — deny every CS you can."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"Leap of Faith turns his dive attempts into a death sentence."},{"when":"Enemy 2+ items","text":"Crit Highlander finally out-duels the field — force the game to end before it."},{"text":"Meditate is a flat 10s: it heals him AND cuts the damage he takes while it channels, so tentacle chip alone stops closing him out. Have Grievous Wounds by your first item or every extended trade resets for free.","when":"1st item"}],"wants":{"you":["A starved Yi through six stages","Ults dropped on his all-in commits","The game closed before his 2-item spike"],"foe":["Scraped farm under tower","Wuju Style true damage on crit","Alpha Strike's untargetable window"]},"early":"Six straight stages are yours, starting immediately: tentacle slams crush his level-1 autos, Test of Spirit turns his soul into a second health bar to beat on, and any Alpha Strike into your field just multiplies your damage. Starve him of every CS — his entire game plan is surviving to items, so make the lane a famine he cannot farm through.","mid":"Level 6 escalates the beating — Leap of Faith walls him inside a tentacle storm, and most dives he attempts simply kill him. First item is when Meditate matters: Grievous Wounds, or his 10s channel refunds your chip. Convert the strangle into map pressure — take plates, shadow his jungler with your lane frozen, and roam to skirmishes where your ult wins everything it touches.","late":"The only chapter he wins is two-plus items, when crit Highlander finally out-duels the field — so your mission is denying him the runway. Push objectives hard through the mid game and close. If it does go late, fight grouped: ult in teamfights where your team punishes his dive, and never hand the farmed Yi the isolated 1v1 he has been starving for.","whys":["Level 1 is Illaoi — tentacle slams out-trade his weak early autos hard.","Level 2 stays yours: the slam plus Test of Spirit controls the lane completely.","Level 3 is yours — a landed spirit test multiplies your damage onto his Alpha Strike commits.","Levels 4-5 stay Illaoi — the tentacle field out-damages anything he attempts.","Level 6 is yours — Leap of Faith walls him in tentacles and can straight-up kill his dive.","First item stays Illaoi: your zone and E pull keep him behind — keep denying.","2+ items goes to Master Yi — Highlander makes him immune to slows, so Iceborn Gauntlet stops holding him in the field."]});
